    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative game about love and hesitation\u2014about the words that you wish to say but never could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic art-style with text-only presentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic gameplay, using Backspace button to progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short yet meaningful experience narrative experience, witness a five-minute conversation between friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615480/extras/17f9ef3d4c4e9b72cc8505df63ac5473.poster.avif?t=1750565102\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615480/extras/17f9ef3d4c4e9b72cc8505df63ac5473.webm?t=1750565102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615480/extras/17f9ef3d4c4e9b72cc8505df63ac5473.mp4?t=1750565102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by Koway</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative game about love and hesitation\u2014about the words that you wish to say but never could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic art-style with text-only presentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic gameplay, using Backspace button to progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short yet meaningful experience narrative experience, witness a five-minute conversation between friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615480/extras/17f9ef3d4c4e9b72cc8505df63ac5473.poster.avif?t=1750565102\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615480/extras/17f9ef3d4c4e9b72cc8505df63ac5473.webm?t=1750565102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615480/extras/17f9ef3d4c4e9b72cc8505df63ac5473.mp4?t=1750565102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by Koway</p>",
